</div></div><div class="dc-specialty gutterdruid" data-source-range="170:171"><div class="dc-specialty-card" id="card-gutterdruid" data-position="even" data-source-range="172:173"><h3>Gutterdruid</h3>
<p class="dc-img-wrapper"><img src="https://placehold.co/300x340/1a1d2b/4a9d6e/png?text=Gutterdruid" alt="Gutterdruid" data-gp-source-token="![Gutterdruid](https://placehold.co/300x340/1a1d2b/4a9d6e/png?text=Gutterdruid)" data-gp-source-occurrence="0"></p>
