<p>The AP chip reads the number: <code>0 AP</code> is free (crimson), a number is standard, <code>VAR</code> or a range is variable (magenta). A raw <code>&lt;span class=&quot;dc-ap&quot;&gt;2 AP&lt;/span&gt;</code> makes a chip in prose.</p>
<h3>Highlight and two columns</h3>
